0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 356.80 Tm (Permanent product law \(Epic #177 FULL PORT\): every matrix row is a full-port target until) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 342.80 Tm (Yes. Qualified Yes is a No. Soft ledger detail is forbidden while status is Yes.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 321.80 Tm (4.1 Prime directive: exceed Bun, npm, and matrix peers for every shipped surface.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 307.80 Tm (Implementation language is pure Common Lisp.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 286.80 Tm (4.2 Purity: no CFFI, native libraries, implementation JS/TS, or shell-outs as product) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 272.80 Tm (implementation shortcuts. Enforce with make purity.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 251.80 Tm (4.3 No hollow exports: every exported API must perform real work or must not be exported.) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 237.80 Tm (Zero product hollows \(Issue #339 closed inventory\).) Tj ET
0 g BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 216.80 Tm (4.4 Man page hard rule: man clun content must always match actual current CLI functionality.) Tj ET
